      "side": 1,
      "message": "That entire class is hidden; now sure what your intentions are here.  Carrier config keys should normally be public; you\u0027re never going to be able to make this a proper API in the future if it refers to hidden implementation details.\n\nAlso, other IKE keys appear to be in the IWLAN section, not at the top level; eg \nKEY_IKE_REKEY_HARD_TIMER_SEC_INT  Should this key be in the same grouping class?",
